<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>Help – LinkSphere</title>
<style>
body {
  margin: 0;
  font-family: "Poppins", sans-serif;
  background: #f5f3f0;
}
/* NAVBAR */
.navbar {
  width: 100%;
  background: #075e54;
  color: #fff;
  padding: 15px 25px;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
}
.navbar a {
  color: #fff;
  margin-left: 20px;
  text-decoration: none;
  font-size: 15px;
}
.navbar a.active {
  font-weight: bold;
  text-decoration: underline;
}
.logo {
  height: 35px;
  margin-right: 10px;
}
.left {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
}
.container {
  width: 70%;
  margin: 40px auto;
}
h1 {
  font-size: 35px;
  color: #075e54;
  text-align: center;
}
.subtitle {
  text-align: center;
  color: #333;
  margin-bottom: 30px;
}
.help-sections {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 20px;
}
.help-card {
  background: #fff;
  border-radius: 8px;
  box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.1);
  padding: 20px;
}
.help-card h2 {
  color: #075e54;
}
.help-card p {
  color: #333;
}
.help-card ul {
  margin-top: 10px;
  padding-left: 20px;
  color: #555;
}
.support-btn {
  display: inline-block;
  margin-top: 10px;
  padding: 10px 15px;
  background: #075e54;
  color: #fff;
  text-decoration: none;
  border-radius: 6px;
}

</style>
</head>

<body>

<!-- NAVBAR -->
<div class="navbar">
  <div class="left">
    <img src="/linksphere.jpg" class="logo">
    <span class="app-name">LinkSphere</span>
  </div>
  <div class="right">
    <a href="/chat">Chats</a>
    <a href="/groups">Groups</a>
    <a href="/status">Status</a>
    <a href="/notifications">Notifications</a>
    <a href="/help" class="active">Help</a>
    <a href="/faq">FAQ</a>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- MAIN -->
<div class="container">
  <h1>Help Center</h1>
  <p class="subtitle">We're here to help you use LinkSphere better</p>

  <div class="help-sections">

    <!-- SECTION 1 -->
    <div class="help-card">
      <h2>Getting Started</h2>
      <p>Learn how to create an account, set up your profile, and start chatting.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>How to register</li>
        <li>How to edit your profile</li>
        <li>How to find contacts</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- SECTION 2 -->
    <div class="help-card">
      <h2>Chats & Messaging</h2>
      <p>Understand how to send messages, media, and manage conversations.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Send and receive messages</li>
        <li>Block or unblock users</li>
        <li>Clear chat or delete chat</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- SECTION 3 -->
    <div class="help-card">
      <h2>Groups</h2>
      <p>Learn how to create, manage, and customize your groups.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Create a group</li>
        <li>Remove participants</li>
        <li>Change group icon or name</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- SECTION 4 -->
    <div class="help-card">
      <h2>Account & Security</h2>
      <p>Protect your account and secure your data on LinkSphere.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Two-factor authentication</li>
        <li>Suspicious login alerts</li>
        <li>Delete your account</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- SECTION 5 -->
    <div class="help-card">
      <h2>Contact Support</h2>
      <p>If you didn’t find what you’re looking for, contact our support team.</p>
      <a href="mailto:support@linksphere.com" class="support-btn">Email Support</a>
    </div>

  </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
